{"slug":"s-b-q","ar":"س ب ق","total":37,"core":"preceding; racing ahead","forms":[{"ar":"سَبَقَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":20,"gloss":"to precede, outstrip","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":171,"p":2,"ar":["وَلَقَدْ","سَبَقَتْ","كَلِمَتُنَا","لِعِبَادِنَا","ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ"],"en":"And Our word has already preceded for Our servants, the messengers"}},{"ar":"سَابِق","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":7,"gloss":"foremost, one who outstrips","word":null,"ex":{"s":56,"a":10,"p":1,"ar":["وَٱلسَّـٰبِقُونَ","ٱلسَّـٰبِقُونَ"],"en":"And the forerunners, the forerunners"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتَبَقَ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":5,"gloss":"to race one another","word":null,"ex":{"s":36,"a":66,"p":6,"ar":["وَلَوْ","نَشَآءُ","لَطَمَسْنَا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَعْيُنِهِمْ","فَٱسْتَبَقُوا۟","ٱلصِّرَٰطَ","فَأَنَّىٰ","يُبْصِرُونَ"],"en":"And if We willed, We could have obliterated their eyes, and they would race to [find] the path, and how could they see"}},{"ar":"مَسْبُوقِين","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"outrun, outstripped","word":null,"ex":{"s":56,"a":60,"p":7,"ar":["نَحْنُ","قَدَّرْنَا","بَيْنَكُمُ","ٱلْمَوْتَ","وَمَا","نَحْنُ","بِمَسْبُوقِينَ"],"en":"We have decreed death among you, and We are not to be outdone"}},{"ar":"سَابِقُ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":1,"gloss":"to race, vie","word":null,"ex":{"s":57,"a":21,"p":1,"ar":["سَابِقُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰ","مَغْفِرَةٍ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","وَجَنَّةٍ","عَرْضُهَا","كَعَرْضِ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","أُعِدَّتْ","لِلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","وَرُسُلِهِۦ ۚ","ذَٰلِكَ","فَضْلُ","ٱللَّهِ","يُؤْتِيهِ","مَن","يَشَآءُ ۚ","وَٱللَّهُ","ذُو","ٱلْفَضْلِ","ٱلْعَظِيمِ"],"en":"Race toward forgiveness from your Lord and a Garden whose width is like the width of the heavens and earth, prepared for those who believed in Allah and His messengers. That is the bounty of Allah which He gives to whom He wills, and Allah is the possessor of great bounty"}},{"ar":"سَبْق","kind":"verbal noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"